window.EXAUD={"If Lan practises every day, she will have the ability to swim 500 metres.": "audio/cau/acb77272bebc7012.mp3", "\"Can\" in this sentence shows ability.": "audio/cau/e1e778d1a8135d61.mp3", "I admire my grandfather for his hard work.": "audio/cau/43f4c43f666a1b38.mp3", "Nam admires his teacher because she is an admirable person.": "audio/cau/a832e698437d0dac.mp3", "It's almost time for lunch.": "audio/cau/2b8687581cfb164a.mp3", "Nam almost missed the bus; he was nearly late.": "audio/cau/6450f2937d81ad4c.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Beautiful beaches attract many tourists.": "audio/cau/4c43d9d7afbbf365.mp3", "Ha Long Bay attracts visitors because it is a famous attraction.": "audio/cau/aeb486068ea88223.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is a popular attraction.": "audio/cau/94088e7e8cf750d8.mp3", "The night market attracts tourists and is a big attraction.": "audio/cau/5a512b8768f85428.mp3", "The city is attractive to young people.": "audio/cau/e65fd9dfdd0db098.mp3", "Bright lights attract visitors and make the street attractive.": "audio/cau/8bfc9fecd3006205.mp3", "Steve Jobs passed away in 2011.": "audio/cau/be8b92331608f7f3.mp3", "My school is 2 km away from my house.": "audio/cau/36a79be5031eac35.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "She became a famous writer at the age of 30.": "audio/cau/d039f1fb340db200.mp3", "Nam's father became a doctor, and Nam wants to become one.": "audio/cau/75c8536f0f8b5b1b.mp3", "The city has become more crowded.": "audio/cau/e4616f3fdd933bf4.mp3", "Lan became a teacher, and her brother will become a doctor.": "audio/cau/534acc7a3aea852d.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "At the beginning of the year, we make plans.": "audio/cau/8f5e00d9babf5811.mp3", "Read the beginning of the story and guess the end.": "audio/cau/04bc139456de0bed.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "My mother bought me a new bag.": "audio/cau/393d28dd65ad4177.mp3", "Nam wants to buy a book; yesterday he bought two.": "audio/cau/9953418f62bdd3ef.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "Put the verbs in brackets in the correct form.": "audio/cau/db94e0ded7cf0ad1.mp3", "Write the word in brackets, like this: (go).": "audio/cau/35267fe98d59e0cc.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "My brother is ten years old.": "audio/cau/8117bffc8b9c9ebf.mp3", "Lan has two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/2a5491a08996a7e7.mp3", "I want to buy a new lamp for my room.": "audio/cau/f0b3e6851a8b52eb.mp3", "Mum bought a sofa, and Dad wants to sell the old one.": "audio/cau/59add360cbe991b8.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "A friend of yours cannot get a good night's sleep.": "audio/cau/44dd417be1715182.mp3", "I cannot hear you. It's too noisy.": "audio/cau/c25f8e78a3e62ab2.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "If you don't wear a coat, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/5bc93b2b49391970.mp3", "Hoa often catches a cold in winter.": "audio/cau/d048751371e6aeb4.mp3", "Too many cars cause traffic jams.": "audio/cau/5ac4cbb3cb2d00fb.mp3", "Pollution is a cause of illness and can cause problems.": "audio/cau/b0502415132a3591.mp3", "There is a community centre in my area.": "audio/cau/29303f0e938051fb.mp3", "The city centre is busy, and the central park is big.": "audio/cau/d087f6159981d3e2.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "Let's go to the cinema on Saturday.": "audio/cau/82161185df4bb4ec.mp3", "This cinema is bigger than the other cinemas.": "audio/cau/72bcaeea6cf8ec13.mp3", "There are three cinemas in my town.": "audio/cau/01533a9fd0e66a8f.mp3", "Mi likes the new cinema more than the old cinemas.": "audio/cau/080d55518db2dec9.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "This shop sells traditional clothes.": "audio/cau/f9f8fc01958edcec.mp3", "These clothes are made from silk cloth.": "audio/cau/19f3df33d3f79b2d.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "Pottery is a common craft in my village.": "audio/cau/015963308cad58f8.mp3", "Bikes are common here, but cars are rare.": "audio/cau/dfea6c78282ac882.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "The project must be completed by Friday.": "audio/cau/a36434b8b918f435.mp3", "Lan completed her homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/9932d454a78dd897.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "He bought his first computer at sixteen.": "audio/cau/89b36254c871cb46.mp3", "She studied computing and now makes computer games.": "audio/cau/bc002ad22303f977.mp3", "Traffic congestion is a big problem in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ee78c5ee3b5db92c.mp3", "The streets are congested, so congestion makes us late.": "audio/cau/22360b232671b312.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Could you tell me the way to the market?": "audio/cau/caec542f1754918b.mp3", "I can swim now, but I could not swim last year.": "audio/cau/15650b94c8bd4313.mp3", "I couldn't sleep because of the noise.": "audio/cau/b74c0028cf6704f5.mp3", "Lan could swim, but she couldn't ride a bike.": "audio/cau/478ae99fe7a51e30.mp3", "Of course, I can help you.": "audio/cau/fd7c10e38552c9bd.mp3", "Mi is taking a cooking course this summer.": "audio/cau/29a5261c025cf175.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "Please cut the paper into small pieces.": "audio/cau/a1fd8b0ff53be3ae.mp3", "Yesterday Nam cut the cake for his friends.": "audio/cau/97279c7011b57f8b.mp3", "My dad is cutting the grass in the garden.": "audio/cau/de769b78036d1e0b.mp3", "We are cutting down on plastic bags, and last month we cut down on paper too.": "audio/cau/9f9ddd6ec177ddbf.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "I didn't go to school yesterday.": "audio/cau/c76b3c893f3c0f4c.mp3", "Nam didn't do his homework, but Lan did.": "audio/cau/16f96f608ec2f72d.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "My uncle can drive a bus.": "audio/cau/64b8207016449130.mp3", "Mum can drive, and yesterday she drove us to the beach.": "audio/cau/2273faa87a513775.mp3", "The bus driver is very kind.": "audio/cau/ebc15215882532a2.mp3", "A taxi driver drives people around the city.": "audio/cau/33fcaee775aa498d.mp3", "Driverless cars may be common in the future.": "audio/cau/42e4361b5356c9a8.mp3", "A driverless bus does not need a driver.": "audio/cau/954e991f99eacb87.mp3", "Sorry, I couldn't get online earlier.": "audio/cau/8645d7f72d7fbd0a.mp3", "I get up early, but my mum gets up earlier.": "audio/cau/1bd88fc4d35df5af.mp3", "Steve Jobs' early life was not easy.": "audio/cau/870d0cf6ff3509a5.mp3", "Lan came early, but Nam came late.": "audio/cau/c338abccaad4e9f4.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "I have a maths exam tomorrow.": "audio/cau/a057069f2c02c041.mp3", "Lan studied hard for the exam, and she passed the test.": "audio/cau/862ea18aaf0d9c06.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "Exhaust from cars pollutes the air.": "audio/cau/dcb901b91191e936.mp3", "The exhaust fumes from motorbikes make the air dirty.": "audio/cau/a4e870c54943e39c.mp3", "Modal verbs express ability, permission or advice.": "audio/cau/9c1f08aacb3d36af.mp3", "Mai uses a drawing to express her feelings.": "audio/cau/e43ecbb0d592515d.mp3", "\"Should\" expresses advice.": "audio/cau/435df393d4a0f8ee.mp3", "\"You can have a little\" expresses permission.": "audio/cau/fd3f3f1661e23726.mp3", "Smoke from factories makes the air dirty.": "audio/cau/c81ab4e4468cc59e.mp3", "My uncle works in a shoe factory near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/cadf22ae030695ea.mp3", "This factory makes bikes and motorbikes.": "audio/cau/f3c9616567191f5a.mp3", "There are many factories in the industrial zone.": "audio/cau/a1bac638f590bcae.mp3", "My school is not far from my house.": "audio/cau/fa693a015c0f0c90.mp3", "Phong's house is farther from school than mine.": "audio/cau/a8e4b376469602b6.mp3", "The park is farther from my house than the school.": "audio/cau/57440ac0cbf1421c.mp3", "Hoa lives far from school, but Lan lives farther.": "audio/cau/1cfcda03be6a4095.mp3", "Lan is interested in fashion and music.": "audio/cau/c16e6190025bd97d.mp3", "These fashionable clothes are popular with teens.": "audio/cau/99dcfa9981242c08.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "I feel happy when I am with my friends.": "audio/cau/347c7145dbd3848c.mp3", "Nam felt tired after the long trip.": "audio/cau/722683185c73007a.mp3", "I have a good feeling about the test.": "audio/cau/fe5f18ce79a79a07.mp3", "Hoa felt proud; it was a wonderful feeling.": "audio/cau/f6b8ed872b819448.mp3", "My mum feels tired after work.": "audio/cau/bc96c68538121391.mp3", "Minh feels at home now, but he felt lost at first.": "audio/cau/7109bc7dc93115b2.mp3", "I can't find my pencil.": "audio/cau/8c42ffdede29d976.mp3", "Lan lost her key, but Nam found it.": "audio/cau/59b8a65c0d818025.mp3", "Mi finds city life exciting.": "audio/cau/43581944ff348c1f.mp3", "Minh finds maths easy, and he found the test easy too.": "audio/cau/aef390d81e1b78f5.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "Lan gives her friend a beautiful flower.": "audio/cau/fa4bac5dc4a6c0ef.mp3", "There are many flowers in my grandma's garden.": "audio/cau/a14860aa91d79b28.mp3", "How about putting some flowers on the table?": "audio/cau/2b9b6c204f34cab8.mp3", "My grandma grows flowers in her garden.": "audio/cau/8e0ebaa5f0e0c564.mp3", "My new school is further from home.": "audio/cau/75bf280216804478.mp3", "Hoa walks far, but Minh walks further.": "audio/cau/2debf8693d0b2c6c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "My grandmother makes a conical hat every day.": "audio/cau/785403050e59025d.mp3", "Lan wears a hat, and her brother has two hats.": "audio/cau/4a6004eb3f79a96b.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Eating vegetables helps you stay healthy.": "audio/cau/db56d82300b94fea.mp3", "Good health is important, so eat healthy food.": "audio/cau/e0e29e3d98c8d03d.mp3", "Can you hear the birds singing?": "audio/cau/3f4cc69da3af7ba9.mp3", "I heard a strange noise last night.": "audio/cau/a1184ef7d4830b99.mp3", "This box is too heavy for me.": "audio/cau/ac63962a8602519b.mp3", "Heavy rain causes floods, and the traffic gets heavier.": "audio/cau/7da989b969861a4f.mp3", "My height is one metre fifty.": "audio/cau/6ed0620c69bbaf2a.mp3", "The tower is very high; its height is 100 metres.": "audio/cau/3baba19856abae04.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "The sky train runs high above the ground.": "audio/cau/8dbedccf6d7409b7.mp3", "Birds fly high in the sky.": "audio/cau/b0c96ceb3c271f43.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "That's a good idea!": "audio/cau/5032b596323554f3.mp3", "Nam has an idea for our project about houses.": "audio/cau/db4e4feff1dcab04.mp3", "Share your ideas with your partner.": "audio/cau/e60ea3abb8907ac1.mp3", "Mi is creative; she always has a new idea.": "audio/cau/962b16602362991f.mp3", "Grandpa is ill, so Linh makes him soup.": "audio/cau/70ca181bb0fbacdc.mp3", "Mi was ill last week; her illness was a bad cold.": "audio/cau/5e8a47ea3c762eea.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "Let me introduce my best friend, Nam.": "audio/cau/5b8362e776b65068.mp3", "Mi wrote a short introduction to introduce herself.": "audio/cau/f3c76dad15928ed4.mp3", "In 1984, Apple introduced the Macintosh.": "audio/cau/7fbc0f1f9822f0f6.mp3", "Nam introduced his sister; the introduction was short.": "audio/cau/3cf0ca71c0273034.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "We were late because of a traffic jam.": "audio/cau/e56d04589badd4a4.mp3", "There is a jam on Le Loi Street, so the roads are jammed.": "audio/cau/927ab8d456162167.mp3", "My father has a job in a hospital.": "audio/cau/5bbe212d5f4f6b36.mp3", "Good job, Mi! You finished your work early.": "audio/cau/1fb5d09e0e0e0c1f.mp3", "We're playing badminton. Do you want to join us, Hoa?": "audio/cau/463866c7dddbef43.mp3", "Nam joined the school football club last year.": "audio/cau/706eaa16ea8a910a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "A lady showed me the way to the bus station.": "audio/cau/34c3b7d031f2d59f.mp3", "The lady and the gentleman are my neighbours.": "audio/cau/0c255a6ade395228.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Don't be late for school!": "audio/cau/2de1bb7c8bcc4ad3.mp3", "Mi was late, but Nam came early.": "audio/cau/1f3ff224e4611670.mp3", "Later, he became a famous doctor.": "audio/cau/07a3d83c155c22a7.mp3", "I was late; I'll call you later.": "audio/cau/48c24516af887381.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "He had to leave school at the age of fifteen.": "audio/cau/0036ab8cf9a331c5.mp3", "We leave home at six; yesterday we left at seven.": "audio/cau/d3d9e5743a9b9bd0.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "My cousin lives in a flat in the city centre.": "audio/cau/6c1c9af9fa483b7a.mp3", "Lan lives in Da Nang, and her grandparents live in Hoi An.": "audio/cau/cad509dd3acaf3f4.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Some villages may lose their traditional crafts.": "audio/cau/bce588b5a80d185a.mp3", "Don't lose your key; I lost mine last week.": "audio/cau/828561b9bfd1a13e.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "Mai loves reading comic books.": "audio/cau/d1b2f4b3c981705e.mp3", "Hoa loves her lovely little cat.": "audio/cau/8facc28663ba700c.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "My mother makes spring rolls at Tet.": "audio/cau/c6bb3a72ed840478.mp3", "Mi makes a cake today; yesterday she made cookies.": "audio/cau/eaa71b7044b2e690.mp3", "The old man makes beautiful bamboo baskets.": "audio/cau/d167eb224af32d1c.mp3", "That man is a potter, and those men are his sons.": "audio/cau/e5423f3250715c84.mp3", "How do you manage to get to school in heavy traffic?": "audio/cau/8761ae4a73d3c515.mp3", "My uncle is a manager; he manages a small hotel.": "audio/cau/4c7dad12218fd85f.mp3", "I managed my time properly.": "audio/cau/fe67d7ad01010081.mp3", "Mai managed her time well last term.": "audio/cau/598d1375d77ac310.mp3", "Good time management helps Mai do well at school.": "audio/cau/67b1d65ea2788b16.mp3", "Minh reads tips on time management.": "audio/cau/160ad9528e8ef2b9.mp3", "Maths is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/c4dbac3c27e1034e.mp3", "Mathematics, or maths, is hard but fun.": "audio/cau/6ffbed30122c7baa.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai!": "audio/cau/fd0dc2a69403ef29.mp3", "I met Lan yesterday, and we will meet again tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1a3d6fe8e8cf61b9.mp3", "Minh Duc likes meeting new people.": "audio/cau/9755b0aa6c0403f3.mp3", "Our class has a meeting on Friday.": "audio/cau/ffb43bba45cd12a8.mp3", "Mai sits in the middle of the first row.": "audio/cau/fb9af6047d7545a8.mp3", "There is a table in the middle, or centre, of the room.": "audio/cau/d1fcde7c79b36590.mp3", "She saved money to buy a new bike.": "audio/cau/47b199504b22fee6.mp3", "Don't waste money; save some money every month.": "audio/cau/6545086d5613a2d1.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "Mr Nam is our English teacher.": "audio/cau/38bbba50eac133a3.mp3", "Mr Minh and Ms Lan work at my school.": "audio/cau/22a842da4f6100e9.mp3", "Ms Hoa teaches us maths.": "audio/cau/f0b35b8376d075b8.mp3", "Ms Lan and Mr Phong are our class teachers.": "audio/cau/6709f6324593fcc8.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "My neighbour is very friendly.": "audio/cau/d2fc8d7467f7e5ea.mp3", "Our neighbour lives in a quiet neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/87674a9bcb6c8bff.mp3", "There are many craft shops in my neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/5a60ecba646b7ca3.mp3", "Friendly neighbours make the neighbourhood a nice place.": "audio/cau/f366b98c116e30a6.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My dad works in an office in the city centre.": "audio/cau/aa89d0f583477234.mp3", "The post office is next to my school.": "audio/cau/3da95b799a14618f.mp3", "A police officer helps people cross the road.": "audio/cau/86b7b65996cb4b92.mp3", "My uncle is an officer, and he works in a big office.": "audio/cau/20f5f9bd56049dd7.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "She started her own business at the age of 25.": "audio/cau/6b63e0d466da083a.mp3", "Lan has her own bike, and her dad owns a shop.": "audio/cau/3e685e99b02109d7.mp3", "Who is the owner of this bag?": "audio/cau/267db4164d6de47a.mp3", "Mi is the owner of the blue bike.": "audio/cau/6fd99520869ed0ff.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "He was born into a poor family.": "audio/cau/f960f9dc0b1abeb6.mp3", "She helped poor children and fought against poverty.": "audio/cau/f7b2c8475fadd81a.mp3", "This singer is popular with teenagers.": "audio/cau/fdbd5fd7ebddf922.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "Put your books on the desk.": "audio/cau/2d454633026296cc.mp3", "Yesterday I put my bike in the garage.": "audio/cau/4337fe6ef9062f07.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "The rain helps the plants grow.": "audio/cau/dcb6145c778bef36.mp3", "It is rainy today, so take an umbrella.": "audio/cau/10a2647a630c9236.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "Give one reason why you like your friend.": "audio/cau/a3f79369c8db7055.mp3", "The price is reasonable, and that is my reason for buying it.": "audio/cau/f927cd67a281473b.mp3", "There are many reasons to make new friends.": "audio/cau/b4aec367cd011148.mp3", "Write two reasons, and explain each reason.": "audio/cau/0e00874bd41b6407.mp3", "Traffic jams are a result of too many cars.": "audio/cau/c6f2d4d7dd7fa222.mp3", "Too many cars result in traffic jams.": "audio/cau/80b013bcff4e245c.mp3", "Rewrite the sentences using the words given.": "audio/cau/803847764ed2304d.mp3", "Lan rewrote her essay after the teacher's comments.": "audio/cau/4be7c7706058675e.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "I run in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/3fed1cc1643c52ce.mp3", "Mi ran very fast; she is a good runner.": "audio/cau/48f4e8245e306883.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "They sell fresh vegetables at the market.": "audio/cau/052ed543aa37b44c.mp3", "Grandma sold flowers; she was a kind seller.": "audio/cau/ea04b190084d53ff.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Our study session starts at seven p.m.": "audio/cau/7c9082abd1e7fdd2.mp3", "Each exercise session lasts thirty minutes.": "audio/cau/45d001343f17edc3.mp3", "Jobs and Wozniak set up Apple in 1976.": "audio/cau/48673803c7bf8992.mp3", "Mi set her alarm for six o'clock yesterday.": "audio/cau/92e32160df23e27c.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "Shortly after that, he moved to Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/11ea9cd1ebe627ae.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so wait here.": "audio/cau/c03ac79a596be37a.mp3", "The timeline shows the important events in his life.": "audio/cau/842231fd94ad1d43.mp3", "This photo shows my grandfather as a young man.": "audio/cau/f9a1966a7b553101.mp3", "Doctors and nurses take care of sick people.": "audio/cau/04035cc5ff019862.mp3", "Lan was ill yesterday and is still sick today.": "audio/cau/aba8602c33bd576e.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "My sister is kind and very funny.": "audio/cau/682ebfe0aa138164.mp3", "I have one sister and two brothers.": "audio/cau/14c3dc4d63096025.mp3", "Swimming is a very useful skill.": "audio/cau/d7241d53b77c087e.mp3", "Mi is skilled at drawing; it's her best skill.": "audio/cau/cc6e45a927c9f99f.mp3", "My uncle is a skilled artisan in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e68305c55d01384c.mp3", "Making pottery is a skill, and he is very skilled.": "audio/cau/9b117236c0cf5e21.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "See you soon at school, Mi!": "audio/cau/fec53904fbd07d51.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so we'll be home soon.": "audio/cau/b92c6bf10bdd4a35.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "Speaking English is fun for me.": "audio/cau/5e0c5c8f032037bd.mp3", "Phong spoke very well at the speaking contest last week.": "audio/cau/a7b7e89c25abf298.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "My grandfather started work when he was fifteen.": "audio/cau/9cd956a07a50d11d.mp3", "The film started at seven and finished at nine.": "audio/cau/7b234820845db47a.mp3", "We stay in tents at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/2e09709e31b8333c.mp3", "Mi will stay at home, but Nam will leave early.": "audio/cau/d5c48ac441b0c097.mp3", "Lan stays with her grandmother on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b44c1a677410d319.mp3", "He usually stays at home, but last week he stayed with us.": "audio/cau/066aab773dd2f3f9.mp3", "My grandparents still live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/49502abae8b9d76c.mp3", "It is late, but Minh is still studying.": "audio/cau/e4f85c62a0bdae64.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "Mai does the most important task first.": "audio/cau/a603b10339a760c3.mp3", "Cleaning the room is Nam's task today.": "audio/cau/ae2aa24fce0f8a61.mp3", "A calendar helps Lan remember her tasks.": "audio/cau/3738ebba96d99a2d.mp3", "Minh writes his tasks on a to-do list.": "audio/cau/071032038aeed4d4.mp3", "We took a taxi to the airport.": "audio/cau/99167b7b2c336807.mp3", "A taxi is fast, but a bus is cheaper.": "audio/cau/16de828ad759348a.mp3", "We are thankful to our teachers.": "audio/cau/7371a36dadb99e53.mp3", "Our teachers help us every day.": "audio/cau/7e121ff7d4ccdde3.mp3", "We have an English test on Friday.": "audio/cau/fa069b3f4f2546b7.mp3", "The teacher will test us before the big exam.": "audio/cau/531cece58d912518.mp3", "I had breakfast, and then I went to school.": "audio/cau/e707895b95dcb0e6.mp3", "First, wash the rice. Next, cook it. Then, eat it.": "audio/cau/2bb6330c0be506ed.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "Mi thinks the summer camp is fun.": "audio/cau/89709f4b5af4b2f5.mp3", "Nam thinks so now, but before he thought differently.": "audio/cau/8492743350975853.mp3", "I bought a train ticket to Hue.": "audio/cau/1debeb8b5ea23da5.mp3", "You need a ticket to enter the museum.": "audio/cau/2dd7e631f582680c.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "I feel tired after a long day at school.": "audio/cau/38f8f044711c6b62.mp3", "The trip was tiring, so we were all tired.": "audio/cau/d54ee95b19e43d5d.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "The traffic is heavy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/42b9fe91ec37a1dd.mp3", "I want to travel around Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/0750a29d21b5efe2.mp3", "He travelled a lot; he was a real traveller.": "audio/cau/4dcdae3874eeaed4.mp3", "We were travelling in Sa Pa when it started to rain.": "audio/cau/24e5da22d18fc04f.mp3", "Travelling helps us learn about new places.": "audio/cau/949a1cf0c4bf897c.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Lan has a beautiful voice.": "audio/cau/d954191d08ca7cbe.mp3", "Please speak in a loud voice so everyone can hear.": "audio/cau/2d63b0a330f935fd.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Nam wanted to make new friends.": "audio/cau/a46c042f58d31655.mp3", "Mai wanted more time to play games.": "audio/cau/108dbb361308f97d.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Workers wear helmets at work.": "audio/cau/58cc64267deb5ef1.mp3", "Mi usually wears jeans, but yesterday she wore a dress.": "audio/cau/23bb4a0107f750d1.mp3", "The electrician wears a uniform.": "audio/cau/e61ef88174b570fe.mp3", "Lan wears glasses, and she wore them in the photo too.": "audio/cau/930bd22d0c295d4b.mp3", "I play football twice a week.": "audio/cau/f42675610892504d.mp3", "Every week we have a weekly test.": "audio/cau/9b6cd05f35e45234.mp3", "I visit my grandparents at the weekend.": "audio/cau/5f08fce8800a0ef9.mp3", "On weekdays I study, but at the weekend I relax.": "audio/cau/7161d9e546310ce2.mp3", "I made a weekly work list.": "audio/cau/43849226d993b20b.mp3", "We have a weekly English club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/c8606fc142f840df.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "I will help you with your homework.": "audio/cau/09b1efdcdb577f02.mp3", "Lan will visit us tomorrow, but Nam won't come.": "audio/cau/b87ff8c1b6e3e1d4.mp3", "She was the first woman to win the prize.": "audio/cau/fd0356da8b619a67.mp3", "That woman is a doctor, and those women are nurses.": "audio/cau/325ae60d55daac3d.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3"};
